// ============================================================================
//  btnEnter.OnSelect  —  guaranteed manual fallback on the landing screen.
//  A normal Button ("View dashboard"); tapping it navigates to the dashboard
//  (by then the data has loaded, so it builds correctly — the exact thing that
//  already works for you). Keep this even if you use tmrGo, as a safety net.
// ============================================================================
Navigate( scrDashboard, ScreenTransition.Fade )
